Rule 6 (non-empty input so reductions are well-defined)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 then true else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 7 (tighter safety margin for numerical stability)
{v_1 : tensor} |= min(v_1) ≥ -0.95 ∧ max(v_1) ≤ 0.95
